WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:12.170
45. Parasites. You probably don't want to think about this, but our bodies are full

2
00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:19.810
of tiny animals. They live off us. They're called parasites. A parasite is a creature

3
00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:26.250
that depends on another creature, called the host, to live. The host, without knowing it,

4
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:32.210
provides food and shelter for the parasite. Some parasites can be very dangerous, even

5
00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:38.530
deadly, while others are harmless. There are many hundreds, even thousands, of types

6
00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:46.610
of parasites that can live on or in humans. One of the most common is the hookworm. Hookworms

7
00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:53.170
live in the intestines and suck blood. They sound frightening, but in fact about 50 percent

8
00:00:53.170 --> 00:01:00.490
of people in the world have hookworms, and most of them feel nothing at all. Hookworms

9
00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:06.250
only become a serious problem when you have too many. Then they can cause people to feel

10
00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:14.050
sick and lose weight. There's a harmless parasite called a tooth amoeba that lives in our mouths.

11
00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:20.410
They live in holes and cavities in our teeth and eat tiny bits of food left behind. Dust

12
00:01:20.410 --> 00:01:27.850
mites are also usually innocuous. They live on our skin and actually eat dead skin. There

13
00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:34.010
are parasites that can live in our eyelashes and eyebrows. You might have them and never know it.

14
00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:41.730
Tapeworms, on the other hand, are very dangerous. They can grow more than 30 feet long, and they

15
00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:47.450
live by eating the food the human host eats. They can kill their hosts by causing them to starve.

16
00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:54.530
River blindness, a terrible disease, is caused by a parasite that gets into our bodies through black

17
00:01:54.530 --> 00:02:02.690
fly bites. The infection these parasites cause can leave people blind. We humans think we rule the

18
00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:09.730
world, but perhaps we should pay more attention to the microscopic creatures that affect us every day.
